                  "type": "textComponent",
                  "text": "Led migration of on-premises SQL Server databases to Azure SQL Cloud; upgraded environments across SQL Server 2005, 2008 R2, 2012, 2014, 2017, 2019, and 2022.\n\nDesigned and deployed an automated SQL Server health check solution to monitor daily backups, database status, disk utilization, blocking, and failed agent jobs.\n\nBuilt automated replication monitoring with real-time alert notifications for replication failures and latency issues, reducing manual oversight by over 40%.\n\nImplemented and managed Always On Availability Groups, database clustering, failover, and load balancing for mission-critical production environments.\n\nPerformed physical database design, capacity planning, index maintenance, and applied service packs/hot-fixes as per application requirements.\n\nDeveloped and maintained T-SQL scripts, utility jobs, and maintenance plans for backup strategy, index rebuilds, and server health checks.\n\nTuned T-SQL queries and stored procedures to optimize performance; monitored locks, long transactions, checkpoints, and space utilization.\n\nEstablished and enforced security access profiles, roles, and change control procedures for development, test, staging, and production environments.\n\nCoordinated with server and network administrators for OS-level tuning to maximize database and application resource utilization."
                }
